<BaseLayout title="Start a conversation · Soter Labs" description="Talk with Soter Labs about a recurring operation, reporting gap, technical system, program, or complex operational mandate." active="contact">
  <header class="page-hero page-hero--apparatus"><div class="page-hero__inner"><p class="page-hero__kicker fade-in">Start with the operation</p><h1 class="page-hero__title fade-in">What needs to run better?</h1><p class="page-hero__lede fade-in">Bring us a recurring process, a reporting gap, a technical system, or a mandate that has become difficult to coordinate. We’ll begin by understanding the work.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section section--flush signature-stage"><div class="section__inner">
    <div class="contact-prompts fade-in"><div><span>01</span><strong>An operation that depends on too few people</strong></div><div><span>02</span><strong>A process whose state is difficult to understand</strong></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Reporting that only shows the surface</strong></div><div><span>04</span><strong>A mandate that needs clearer ownership</strong></div><div><span>05</span><strong>A launch crossing multiple teams</strong></div><div><span>06</span><strong>Infrastructure that needs an operating method</strong></div></div>
    <div class="detail-card contact-card fade-in"><p class="section__eyebrow">Direct line</p><h2 class="detail-card__title">Tell us what you are navigating.</h2><p class="detail-card__body">A person reads every message. Helpful context includes what the operation is expected to accomplish, how it works today, who depends on it, and any deadline or constraint already in motion.</p><a href="mailto:hello@soterlabs.com?subject=Starting%20a%20conversation%20with%20Soter" class="btn" data-umami-event="contact-email-click">hello@soterlabs.com →</a><div class="profile-actions"><a href="https://x.com/soterlabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="section-link">@soterlabs on X ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/soterlabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="section-link">GitHub ↗</a></div></div>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
